<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>My Linux notes on Benjamin Italiaander</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/</link><description>Recent content in My Linux notes on Benjamin Italiaander</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Bestanden zoeken zonder verborgen bestanden</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="bestanden-zoeken-en-verborgen--bestanden-overslaan"&gt;Bestanden zoeken en verborgen (&lt;code&gt;.*&lt;/code&gt;) bestanden overslaan&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;find /home/user ! -path &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;*/.*&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; -type f
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vervang &lt;code&gt;/home/user&lt;/code&gt; door de map waarin je wilt zoeken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verander &lt;code&gt;-type f&lt;/code&gt; (bestanden) in &lt;code&gt;-type d&lt;/code&gt; om mappen te zoeken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Linux CLI-spiekbriefje (dagelijks gebruik)</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="-linux-cli-spiekbriefje-dagelijks-gebruik"&gt;🧠 Linux CLI-spiekbriefje (dagelijks gebruik)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-zoeken-in-de-geschiedenis"&gt;🔎 Zoeken in de geschiedenis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + r &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Terugzoeken (typ om te zoeken, druk nogmaals voor oudere treffers)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + s &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Vooruit zoeken (staat vaak standaard uit)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# De commandogeschiedenis tonen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; grep ssh &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Zoeken in de geschiedenis met grep&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!123 &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Commando nummer 123 uit de geschiedenis uitvoeren&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!! &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Het vorige commando uitvoeren&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!ssh &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Het laatste commando dat met &amp;#34;ssh&amp;#34; begint uitvoeren&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-de-cursor-verplaatsen-superhandig"&gt;✏️ De cursor verplaatsen (SUPERhandig)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + a &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Naar het begin van de regel&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + e &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Naar het eind van de regel&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Alt + b &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Eén woord terug&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Alt + f &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Eén woord vooruit&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + x x &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Wisselen tussen begin van de regel en de cursor&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-bewerken-en-verwijderen"&gt;✂️ Bewerken en verwijderen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + u &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Verwijderen van cursor → begin&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + k &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Verwijderen van cursor → eind&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + w &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Vorige woord verwijderen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + d &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Teken onder de cursor verwijderen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + h &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Teken vóór de cursor verwijderen (backspace)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + y &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Laatst verwijderde tekst plakken (yank)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-scherm-leegmaken--resetten"&gt;🧹 Scherm leegmaken / resetten&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + l &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Scherm leegmaken (hetzelfde als &amp;#39;clear&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;clear &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Scherm leegmaken&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;reset &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Terminal volledig resetten (voor een kapotte terminal)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-processen-beheren"&gt;⏸️ Processen beheren&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + c &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Huidige commando stoppen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + z &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Pauzeren (naar de achtergrond)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;fg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Terughalen naar de voorgrond&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;bg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Op de achtergrond verder laten lopen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;jobs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Achtergrondjobs tonen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-navigeren-en-basis"&gt;📁 Navigeren en basis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; - &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Naar de vorige map&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;pwd&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Huidige map tonen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ls -lah &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Bestanden tonen (uitgebreid + leesbare groottes)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tree &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Mappenstructuur tonen (als het geïnstalleerd is)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-handige-sneltoetsen"&gt;⚡ Handige sneltoetsen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Tab &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Bestanden/commando&amp;#39;s automatisch aanvullen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Tab Tab &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Alle mogelijkheden tonen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + p &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Vorig commando (zoals ↑)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + n &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Volgend commando (zoals ↓)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-pro-tips"&gt;🧠 Pro-tips&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo !! &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Het vorige commando opnieuw uitvoeren met sudo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!$ &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Laatste argument van het vorige commando&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# voorbeeld:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mkdir &lt;span class="nb"&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; !$ &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# gaat naar test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;^oud^nieuw &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Tekst in het vorige commando vervangen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# voorbeeld:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ls /var/logg
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;^logg^log &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# verbetert de typfout&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-geschiedenis-wissen-pas-op-"&gt;🧼 Geschiedenis wissen (pas op 😄)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; -c &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Geschiedenis van de huidige sessie wissen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; -w &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Wijzigingen naar ~/.bash_history schrijven&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-bonus-zsh--oh-my-zsh"&gt;🔧 Bonus (zsh / oh-my-zsh)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + r &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Zoeken in de geschiedenis&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Installeer fzf voor nog beter zoeken:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Ctrl + r wordt dan een interactieve fuzzy search&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mijn Linux-notities</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een verzameling notities van de kleine Linux-projecten die ik bouw en waarmee ik experimenteer. Kijk gerust rond: bij elke notitie staat een link naar de Nederlandse versie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- note-index:start --&gt;
&lt;!-- Generated by make_index.py — do not edit between these markers. --&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-index"&gt;📚 Index&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;53 notes, each in 🇬🇧 English and 🇳🇱 Nederlands. 🤖 = translated with AI · met AI vertaald.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OpenPGP / GnuPG-spiekbriefje</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="een-korte-lijst-met-belangrijke-commandos-die-ik-met-gnupg-gebruik"&gt;Een korte lijst met belangrijke commando&amp;rsquo;s die ik met GnuPG gebruik&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="yubikey-en-gnupg-openpgp--gpg"&gt;YubiKey en GnuPG (OpenPGP / gpg)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Begin met:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;# open the card menu for your YubiKey
gpg --card-edit

# Now enter the admin command
gpg/card&amp;gt; admin

# Now enter help to see all available commands
gpg/card&amp;gt; help
quit quit this menu
admin show admin commands
help show this help
list list all available data
name change card holder&amp;#39;s name
url change URL to retrieve key
fetch fetch the key specified in the card URL
login change the login name
lang change the language preferences
salutation change card holder&amp;#39;s salutation
cafpr change a CA fingerprint
forcesig toggle the signature force PIN flag
generate generate new keys
passwd menu to change or unblock the PIN
verify verify the PIN and list all data
unblock unblock the PIN using a Reset Code
factory-reset destroy all keys and data
kdf-setup setup KDF for PIN authentication
key-attr change the key attribute
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toon alle sleutels op een YubiKey, inclusief hun keygrips:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OTP-generator in Bash</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="een-otpmfa-tool-maken-in-de-bash-terminal"&gt;Een OTP/MFA-tool maken in de Bash-terminal&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ik was &lt;strong&gt;Google Authenticator&lt;/strong&gt; zat, dus zocht ik een eenvoudige manier om zelf &lt;strong&gt;OTP-codes (eenmalige wachtwoorden)&lt;/strong&gt; te maken, direct in &lt;strong&gt;Bash&lt;/strong&gt;.
Vervang de voorbeeldtekst hieronder (&lt;code&gt;JHJH...&lt;/code&gt;) door je eigen geheime sleutel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/usr/bin/oathtool -b --totp &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;JHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJ&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wil je de code meteen naar je klembord kopiëren, gebruik dan &lt;strong&gt;xclip&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/usr/bin/oathtool -b --totp &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;JHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJ&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; xclip -selection c
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zo heb je eenvoudig je eigen OTP-generator in de terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Find Files, Excluding Hidden Files</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Sep 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;🇳🇱 &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/find_exclude_hidden_files_nl/"&gt;Lees deze pagina in het Nederlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="find-files-and-ignore-hidden--files"&gt;Find files and ignore hidden (&lt;code&gt;.*&lt;/code&gt;) files&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;find /home/user ! -path &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;*/.*&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; -type f
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace &lt;code&gt;/home/user&lt;/code&gt; with the folder you want to search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change &lt;code&gt;-type f&lt;/code&gt; (files) to &lt;code&gt;-type d&lt;/code&gt; to find directories instead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Linux CLI Cheatsheet (Daily Use)</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Aug 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;🇳🇱 &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/cheatsheet_bash_nl/"&gt;Lees deze pagina in het Nederlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="-linux-cli-cheatsheet-daily-use"&gt;🧠 Linux CLI Cheatsheet (Daily Use)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-search-in-history"&gt;🔎 Search in History&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + r &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Reverse search (type to search, keep pressing for older matches)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + s &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Forward search (often disabled by default)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Show command history&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; grep ssh &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Search history with grep&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!123 &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Run command number 123 from history&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!! &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Run last command&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!ssh &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Run last command starting with &amp;#34;ssh&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-cursor-movement-super-useful"&gt;✏️ Cursor Movement (SUPER useful)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + a &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Go to beginning of line&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + e &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Go to end of line&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Alt + b &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Move back one word&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Alt + f &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Move forward one word&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + x x &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Jump between start of line and cursor&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-editing--deleting"&gt;✂️ Editing &amp;amp; Deleting&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + u &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Delete from cursor → start&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + k &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Delete from cursor → end&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + w &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Delete previous word&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + d &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Delete character under cursor&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + h &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Delete character before cursor (backspace)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + y &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Paste last deleted text (yank)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-clear-screen--reset"&gt;🧹 Clear Screen / Reset&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + l &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Clear screen (same as &amp;#39;clear&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;clear &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Clear screen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;reset &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Full terminal reset (fix broken terminal)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-process-control"&gt;⏸️ Process Control&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + c &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Stop current command&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + z &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Suspend (background)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;fg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Bring back to foreground&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;bg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Resume in background&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;jobs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# List background jobs&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-navigation--basics"&gt;📁 Navigation &amp;amp; Basics&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; - &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Go to previous directory&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;pwd&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Show current directory&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ls -lah &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# List files (detailed + human readable)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tree &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Show directory structure (if installed)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-handy-shortcuts"&gt;⚡ Handy Shortcuts&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Tab &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Auto-complete files/commands&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Tab Tab &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Show all possibilities&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + p &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Previous command (like ↑)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + n &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Next command (like ↓)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-pro-tips"&gt;🧠 Pro Tips&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo !! &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Rerun last command with sudo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!$ &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Last argument of previous command&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# example:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mkdir &lt;span class="nb"&gt;test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; !$ &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# goes into test&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;^old^new &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Replace text in last command&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# example:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ls /var/logg
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;^logg^log &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# fixes typo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-clear-history-careful-"&gt;🧼 Clear History (careful 😄)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; -c &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Clear current session history&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;history&lt;/span&gt; -w &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Write changes to ~/.bash_history&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-bonus-zsh--oh-my-zsh"&gt;🔧 Bonus (zsh / oh-my-zsh)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Ctrl + r &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# History search&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Install fzf for an even better search:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Ctrl + r becomes an interactive fuzzy search&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bash OTP Generator</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator/</link><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;🇳🇱 &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/bash_otp_generator_nl/"&gt;Lees deze pagina in het Nederlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="create-an-otp-mfa-tool-in-the-bash-terminal"&gt;Create an OTP MFA Tool in the Bash Terminal&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was tired of using &lt;strong&gt;Google Authenticator&lt;/strong&gt;, so I found a simple way to generate my own &lt;strong&gt;OTP (One-Time Password)&lt;/strong&gt; codes directly in &lt;strong&gt;Bash&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
Just replace the example string below (&lt;code&gt;JHJH...&lt;/code&gt;) with your own secret key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/usr/bin/oathtool -b --totp &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;JHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJ&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you want to copy the token directly to your clipboard, just use &lt;strong&gt;xclip&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/usr/bin/oathtool -b --totp &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;JHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJHJ&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; xclip -selection c
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This way, you can easily run your own OTP generator right in the terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OpenPGP / GnuPG Cheat Sheet</title><link>https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Mar 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;🇳🇱 &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/Linux/OpenPGP_GnuPG_cheat_sheet_nl/"&gt;Lees deze pagina in het Nederlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="a-short-list-of-important-commands-i-use-with-gnupg"&gt;A short list of important commands I use with GnuPG&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="yubikey-and-gnupg-openpgp--gpg"&gt;YubiKey and GnuPG (OpenPGP / gpg)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;# open the card menu for your YubiKey
gpg --card-edit

# Now enter the admin command
gpg/card&amp;gt; admin

# Now enter help to see all available commands
gpg/card&amp;gt; help
quit quit this menu
admin show admin commands
help show this help
list list all available data
name change card holder&amp;#39;s name
url change URL to retrieve key
fetch fetch the key specified in the card URL
login change the login name
lang change the language preferences
salutation change card holder&amp;#39;s salutation
cafpr change a CA fingerprint
forcesig toggle the signature force PIN flag
generate generate new keys
passwd menu to change or unblock the PIN
verify verify the PIN and list all data
unblock unblock the PIN using a Reset Code
factory-reset destroy all keys and data
kdf-setup setup KDF for PIN authentication
key-attr change the key attribute
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;List all keys on a YubiKey, including their keygrips:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>